{"id":"vod_sn_36967","vodId":"36967","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"龙之界点","name_cn":"龙之界点","date":"2011-01-01","year":"2011","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/aaf3d17c2a16e9a6b66e6aa2b953f39a.jpg"},"summary":"如月龙司（下野纮 配音）只是一介普通高中生，没想到表姐七尾英理子（野上尤加奈 配音）从国外带回来的一个神秘木箱彻底颠覆了他平凡的命运。在木箱中的，躺着一个叫萝丝（钉宫理惠 配音）的金发少女。少女对龙司一见钟情，而面对少女火热和直接的表白，龙司只是感到十分的困扰。就这样，龙司和萝丝的“幸福”生活开始了。　　萝丝的真实身份为龙之少女，她的失踪在黑道上引起了轩然大波。为了夺回萝丝，黑道派出了邪恶的黑暗组织。在波折中，龙司逐渐发现了自己对萝丝的真正心意，为了保护自己所爱的人，他决定拿出勇气和力量，于黑恶势力决一死战。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:47:39","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/QuF4E0ZRGe1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/4VCFxiPkzB1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/6DcUBB6x1Z1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/uFwt1MZ0Tj1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/pQRHrLHwxX1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/RdwGxzEG5U1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/KUQVYgXfYZ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/rmt5RhQNaj1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/K6ij5zDtaY1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/3uKAELt4zY1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/VkJKgB4YtL1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Pj2CkGUtTH1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:16.878Z"}